  "live_records": {
    "q-131311": {
      "dom_id": "step-q131311",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Which of the following random variables could be modeled using a Poisson distribution?\n\n- The number of network failures per week\n- The number of emergency calls received by a hospital every minute\n- The number of members of a band",
      "worked_solution": "A Poisson distribution models the number of events that occur in an interval of time or space if events occur independently and at a constant average rate.\n\nWith that in mind, let's consider each of the given random variables.\n\n- Random variable I follows a Poisson distribution. The number of network failures can be modeled as independent events with a constant average rate, and we wish to know how many events occur in an interval of time (a week).\n\n- Random variable II follows a Poisson distribution.  The number of emergency calls received can be modeled as independent events with a constant average rate, and we wish to know how many events occur in an interval of time (a minute).\n\n- Random variable III does *not* follow a Poisson distribution. There are no events that occur at a constant average rate, and there is no interval of time or space.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-131311-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I only",
              "html": " I only"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-131311-b",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II and III only",
              "html": " II and III only"
            },
            {
              "option": "c",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-131311-c",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I and II only",
              "html": " I and II only"
            },
            {
              "option": "d",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-131311-d",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I and III only",
              "html": " I and III only"
            },
            {
              "option": "e",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-131311-e",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II only",
              "html": "II only"
            }
